        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86613, Rectangular Riviera Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Riviera Cabinet Knob is a stunning transitional pull from Emtek. Available in the design world's best trending finish color options. The Riviera Rectangular Cabinet Knob is a nice sized kitchen cabinet knob that is well-suited for large cabinet doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-riviera-square-cabinet-knob-emtek-86612\"><b>Riviera Square Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/riviera-cabinet-pull-emtek-86614\"><b>Riviera Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/riviera-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86621\"><b>Riviera Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Riviera Rectangular Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"x 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86613-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262439\"><b>Emtek 86613 Specifications (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
